sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff
    participant UI as Android UI
    participant Local as Local DB / command outbox
    participant WM as Persistent sync worker
    participant API as Sync API
    participant Auth as Current authorization
    participant Domain as Owning domain module
    participant Server as Authoritative DB / idempotency / outbox

    Staff->>UI: Save eligible offline action
    UI->>Local: Atomic draft/projection + immutable command
    Local-->>UI: Durable client command/resource ID
    UI-->>Staff: Saved on this phone / pending

    WM->>Local: Claim pending command batch
    WM->>API: Submit commands with stable IDs/base versions
    API->>Auth: Reauthenticate and authorize each command
    Auth-->>API: Current decision
    API->>Domain: Invoke typed idempotent command
    Domain->>Server: Validate and commit state/audit/outbox/result
    Server-->>Domain: Accepted, duplicate, conflict or rejected
    Domain-->>API: Typed result + authoritative projection/version
    API-->>WM: Per-command outcomes + change cursor/page
    WM->>Local: Atomic results/projections/tombstones/cursor
    Local-->>UI: Observed local state updates
    UI-->>Staff: Synchronized or needs attention
